  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Binh Duong Waste Management and Energy Efficiency Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proceeds will be used for the purpose of financing the operation and expansion of (i) a composting plant with a capacity of 840 tons/day and (ii) an industrial and municipal solid waste incinerator using waste to energy (WTE) technology with a capacity of 200 tons/day at the South Binh Duong Solid Waste Treatment Complex in Binh Duong Province, Viet Nam.</narrative>
  </description>
